-80a6ca0d2026","description":"Um alevino","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7c00-b414-f1a7e1ca2123","description":"Um filhote de coelho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-72aa-ac8b-aa24aa01685d","description":"Um girino","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-748c-93a2-f4398ccf4f27","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual termo se aplica a um espa\u00e7o desprovido de mat\u00e9ria?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um v\u00e1cuo perfeito n\u00e3o cont\u00e9m mat\u00e9ria, mas mesmo o espa\u00e7o interestelar possui algumas part\u00edculas; portanto, n\u00e3o est\u00e1 completamente vazio.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7d46-9d80-9a7acd7b7f0e","description":"V\u00e1cuo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7f89-8134-08ff6ebbb075","description":"Mat\u00e9ria Escura","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7139-9637-9df733910647","description":"Buraco Negro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7a9d-a5d7-845e682a2048","description":"Buraco Branco","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-787b-ad78-f9557767f946","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"De que alimento os pandas gigantes da China se alimentam quase que exclusivamente?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O bambu \u00e9 um tipo de grama, e os pandas gigantes passam grande parte do dia comendo-o porque ele fornece relativamente poucos nutrientes.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7114-ba41-5050f4ba2901","description":"Bambu","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-70c8-8465-368a22fec08b","description":"Eucalipto","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-75d1-a810-875743928e4f","description":"Avel\u00e3s","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7906-891c-9e35556f20e1","description":"Ma\u00e7\u00e3s","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-757c-b005-9bdee332a9f0","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a abrevia\u00e7\u00e3o do pol\u00edmero que carrega as instru\u00e7\u00f5es gen\u00e9ticas das c\u00e9lulas vivas?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"As duas cadeias do DNA se entrela\u00e7am formando uma dupla h\u00e9lice, e as sequ\u00eancias de suas bases qu\u00edmicas codificam a informa\u00e7\u00e3o heredit\u00e1ria.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7b6b-86fe-0514ddc8e189","description":"DNA","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-766d-9861-edaaff00958f","description":"GCI","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7ed3-a70d-9dbd06fb79e6","description":"ATP","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7391-b132-4190be551de5","description":"COD","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-74ca-80b2-b10abe7651b2","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a cobra-real usa para matar suas presas?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O veneno da cobra-real cont\u00e9m neurotoxinas que interferem na transmiss\u00e3o dos sinais nervosos e podem causar paralisia.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7927-914b-458ab07792c9","description":"Veneno","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7d31-bb79-c624306faaea","description":"Olhar fixo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7b1c-9bde-5200e04bcc52","description":"Choque","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7632-aea6-e357caed9d19","description":"Persuas\u00e3o","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-71e2-a4f9-f375820db976","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual foi o primeiro objeto celeste em que a humanidade pisou?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A Lua foi alcan\u00e7ada pela Apollo 11 em 1969, quando Neil Armstrong e Buzz Aldrin se tornaram as primeiras pessoas a caminhar em sua superf\u00edcie.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7307-b575-c089982a2b70","description":"A Lua","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7f52-a878-af05b79242c1","description":"O Sol","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-778d-ab2e-6e80325ae8b5","description":"O cometa de Halley","correct_ans