{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-72fb-8a3c-c8d47bd7c940","description":"3,14","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7ed9-92f2-fb0d18264b6a","description":"3,41","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7b80-af2e-7ed01283e85e","description":"4,31","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7126-af33-db0f2af562fd","description":"1,34","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-70cf-9f60-686004e983d7","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que \u00e9 usado como desinfetante em piscinas?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O cloro ajuda a eliminar micr\u00f3bios nocivos da \u00e1gua da piscina. O cheiro forte e caracter\u00edstico das piscinas geralmente vem das cloraminas, formadas quando o cloro reage com contaminantes.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-705e-b6ac-e105d6623a86","description":"Cloro","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-70a0-a5e1-2f5f7827380f","description":"Enxofre","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7a49-bf92-cb36d7711f6d","description":"Carbono","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-79d3-926e-86fda41c6a3d","description":"Cobalto","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-733e-8b98-fefbad5237bb","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que os submarinos utilizam para observar a superf\u00edcie a partir de uma posi\u00e7\u00e3o oculta?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um perisc\u00f3pio redireciona a luz, permitindo que algu\u00e9m veja por cima de um obst\u00e1culo enquanto permanece oculto.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7b0e-911b-119c8e0bd04a","description":"Perisc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7def-a450-62b9fdf4bf6e","description":"Episc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7af6-ab92-2330f2aaa9e4","description":"Estrobosc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7e2e-ac70-709fba6c3794","description":"Estetosc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-76a8-862a-99cdf0fbec84","category":"01a2135e-