mulada de radia\u00e7\u00e3o\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7e0b-8377-ad521c69e535","description":"Luz","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7dac-874e-54c9cd151f2c","description":"Baixa","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-73d0-9818-8e5336aba3c4","description":"Longa","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-74ae-95f6-e8c89fbd3aff","description":"Grande","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-743d-bf0d-88e4dac345b5","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quanto tempo a Terra leva para orbitar o Sol?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A \u00f3rbita da Terra leva cerca de 365,25 dias; portanto, os dias bissextos ajudam a manter o calend\u00e1rio alinhado com as esta\u00e7\u00f5es do ano.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7837-8392-9d740813e93b","description":"1 ano","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-77c6-9aa7-8c612867aeb0","description":"1 dia","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-73df-8566-8955b13e415b","description":"28 dias","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7009-bfe8-a5825fb034ac","description":"1 m\u00eas","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-704b-a86e-d7923a6849e1","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama uma figura geom\u00e9trica com tr\u00eas lados?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Na geometria euclidiana, a soma dos \u00e2ngulos internos de um tri\u00e2ngulo \u00e9 igual a 180 graus, e seus tr\u00eas lados fazem dele o pol\u00edgono mais simples.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7ae6-b16c-76ad9726a98b","description":"Tri\u00e2ngulo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-764e-bc05-56c30be335aa","description":"Quadrado","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7827-9cb6-43382edbf3d9","description":"Paralelogramo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7109-b6c2-c513dcf36dc9","description":"Trapezoide","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-77f8-9cb2-6eaed0630c14","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Que g\u00e1s \u00e9 produzido durante a combust\u00e3o incompleta do carv\u00e3o vegetal?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O mon\u00f3xido de carbono se forma quando um combust\u00edvel que cont\u00e9m carbono queima com oxig\u00eanio insuficiente. Ele \u00e9 perigoso porque se liga \u00e0 hemoglobina e reduz a capacidade do sangue de transportar oxig\u00eanio.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-77bc-9951-7cb295f477fc","description":"Mon\u00f3xido de carbono","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7fe1-945f-9cf4538e6ddf","description":"Di\u00f3xido de carbono","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-747d-b003-b7c73886d8bb","description":"Metano","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7c11-814f-1b18e4c4617c","description":"Nitrog\u00eanio","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7d27-b65b-25ab3bfb7a7b","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Em que parte da garganta humana est\u00e1 localizada a epiglote?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A laringe abriga a epiglote, uma aba cartilaginosa que ajuda a impedir que alimentos e l\u00edquidos entrem nas vias respirat\u00f3rias durante a degluti\u00e7\u00e3o.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7d55-a14e-11faf09c5561","description":"Laringe (caixa vocal)","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-75bd-a5f3-964027532352","description":"Orelha","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7779-b948-20a7520db5e7","description":"Est\u00f4mago","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7552-85c1-b2536640dbc9","description":"F\u00edgado","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-762f-996a-7c7b0a717b2a","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual das seguintes part\u00edculas N\u00c3O possui carga el\u00e9trica?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Os neutrinos s\u00e3o eletricamente neutros e apresentam os tipos el\u00e9tron, m\u00faon e tau; os el\u00e9trons, m\u00faons e taus, por sua vez, possuem carga el\u00e9trica.","alternat