23f","description":"Toque de sino","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-757b-9920-6118d858d864","description":"Doen\u00e7as reum\u00e1ticas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-77ae-9a61-b4176e62699b","description":"S\u00edfilis","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7a3e-a936-a20df78b335a","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual cientista teria se inspirado na queda de uma ma\u00e7\u00e3 para desenvolver sua teoria da gravidade?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A lei da gravita\u00e7\u00e3o universal de Isaac Newton descreve a mesma for\u00e7a que atrai uma ma\u00e7\u00e3 em dire\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 Terra e mant\u00e9m os planetas em \u00f3rbita.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7c90-9cfa-773eb48da18c","description":"Isaac Newton","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7d5d-8833-7f97c0570629","description":"Charles Darwin","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7409-b779-c031bda8d24d","description":"Galileu Galilei","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7161-bb65-7b17f2feb0cc","description":"Ernest Rutherford","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7564-afc8-af65287ac4e9","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar uma raposa f\u00eamea?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Uma raposa f\u00eamea \u00e9 chamada de \u201cvixen\u201d; a raposa macho costuma ser chamada de \u201cdog\u201d, e uma raposa jovem \u00e9 chamada de \u201ccub\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7efd-92d2-8ab0d152fba7","description":"Uma raposa f\u00eamea","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7234-b1a4-00322cb7124a","description":"Uma ovelha","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-73fa-9096-67a825790ce4","description":"Uma galinha","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7ddf-9bb9-088296a02738","description":"Uma cor\u00e7a","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-71a0-af92-4598f328dde7","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"As ra\u00e7as siamesa e birmanesa s\u00e3o de quais animais?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Os gatos da ra\u00e7a siamesa geralmente t\u00eam olhos azuis e pelagem com pontos coloridos, enquanto os gatos birmaneses costumam ter pelagem curta e brilhante.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7bd1-8d10-f6d8a91ddd98","description":"Gato","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-77a4-b210-8facddc2484e","description":"Cachorro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-730e-a784-079210a8a6ec","description":"Burro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7691-aaf9-e557d56f70e0","description":"Porco","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7129-ad87-b438971e0c22","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quem \u00e9 conhecido por sua teoria da evolu\u00e7\u00e3o por sele\u00e7\u00e3o natural?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Charles Darwin apresentou sua teoria na obra \u201cA Origem das Esp\u00e9cies\u201d, com base nas observa\u00e7\u00f5es feitas durante sua viagem a bordo do HMS Beagle.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7a16-b761-3140c09d2197","description":"Charles Darwin","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7ce1-bb69-e75d2f2134d1","description":"Albert Einstein","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7348-b2a9-54f83e1d16f3","description":"Niels Bohr","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7663-bcd0-f28e9911ba2d","description":"Sigmund Freud","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7a3e-93fa-ce092d1389ca","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quantos quilates tem o ouro puro?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O ouro de 24 quilates \u00e9 considerado puro; classifica\u00e7\u00f5es inferiores indicam que outros metais comp\u00f5em parte da liga.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-720d-85cd-d31b8192cae5","description":"24 quilates","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7f68-b4e0-afab5069dcf2","description":"22 quilates","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7687-baf4-4492596b9120","description":"30 quilates","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7fd8-a3da-a5405b70a001","description":"12 quilates","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-71bb-b9f4-6b428d8d1e94","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Para que serve principalmente o radar?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Radar \u00e9 a sigla para \u201cdetec\u00e7\u00e3o e localiza\u00e7\u00e3o por r\u00e1dio\u201d; o tempo que as ondas de r\u00e1dio refletidas levam para retornar pode revelar a que dist\u00e2ncia algo se encontra.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-72f5-ae7e-49987bf0722b","description":"Detec\u00e7\u00e3o de objetos","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7c30-bcaf-485dbf48d708","description":"Amplifica\u00e7\u00e3o de som","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-71cc-85fb-003066c495f0","description":"Gera\u00e7\u00e3o de eletricidade","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7546-aac3-2b9f131b2d13","description":"Medindo a temperatura","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-72d6-b8f5-9d5c2ca00f38","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Que instrumento podemos usar para observar as estrelas?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um telesc\u00f3pio capta e concentra a luz, facilitando a observa\u00e7\u00e3o de estrelas distantes. Muitos telesc\u00f3pios de grandes observat\u00f3rios usam espelhos para captar essa luz.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7c8c-ae12-a726975efad6","description":"Telesc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7938-b168-5728631e9761","description":"Perisc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7fd7-bfac-e972404c4b1d","description":"Endosc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-754e-945e-decb02a24d54","description":"Microsc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-78e4-9174-8a9290c5d98a","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual teoria descreve o in\u00edcio do nosso universo?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A teoria do Big Bang descreve o universo se expandindo a partir de um estado extremamente quente e denso. O fundo c\u00f3smico de micro-ondas \u00e9 frequentemente descrito como o resplendor remanescente desse universo primitivo.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-758b-96a8-1b845e16a537","description":"Big Bang","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7c4e-8b09-5cf15649ac70","description":"Supernova","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-79f0-8e56-4c22b6654bca","description":"Modelo Padr\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7afd-8fdf-7397c9e1654d","description":"Relatividade Especial","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7c32-9a70-d21384206ccf","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a causa direta do diabetes tipo I?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"No diabetes tipo I, o sistema imunol\u00f3gico destr\u00f3i as c\u00e9lulas beta produtoras de insulina no p\u00e2ncreas, o que faz com que a glicemia aumente.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7023-b782-c85d7dbb1a6b","description":"Insulina insuficiente","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7f61-b9e8-0b526c0c1cc5","description":"Estrog\u00eanio insuficiente","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7397-a62f-5471ef6c7fd2","description":"C\u00e1lcio insuficiente","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7821-826b-26901f8264f8","description":"Falta de magn\u00e9sio","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af2f-7252-9cb3-ff459f80216d","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que \u00e9 a transi\u00e7\u00e3o da fase l\u00edquida para a fase s\u00f3lida?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O congelamento \u00e9 o processo inverso ao derretimento; a ebuli\u00e7\u00e3o e a condensa\u00e7\u00e3o s\u00e3o mudan\u00e7as de fase que envolvem um g\u00e1s.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7eb8-8ca8-caa5d266629d","description":"Congelamento","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7bad-8873-f11467d4c728","description":"Derretimento","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7665-8b26-0c1d0edf100e","description":"Ebul\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-75d4-abf9-a0e1ec6f031b","description":"Condensa\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7dd0-9942-5ba0df94c16a","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama a pr\u00e1tica de cultivar plantas em l\u00edquidos, em vez de solo?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A hidroponia fornece nutrientes \u00e0s ra\u00edzes das plantas por meio de uma solu\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 base de \u00e1gua. O nome combina ra\u00edzes gregas que significam \u201c\u00e1gua\u201d e \u201ctrabalho\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af30-779b-8fea-80610f162b77","description":"Hidroponia","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7ddd-808f-8745593a6f11","description":"Aqu\u00f4nica","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-729d-89b6-10c3a691bfb9","description":"Horticultura","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-746b-9801-b6acdf100637","description":"Cultura aqu\u00e1tica","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7c64-b006-14ec31a81488","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a principal fonte de energia da Terra?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O Sol fornece a maior parte da energia que chega \u00e0 Terra, aquecendo o planeta e alimentando processos como o clima e a fotoss\u00edntese.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af30-770c-86e9-9deba1536cf9","description":"Sol","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7bc8-8bb8-caebb47c8800","description":"Lua","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7ead-a3d4-329c67674aff","description":"V\u00eanus","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-753c-ae11-8570ce9e902f","description":"Alfa Centauri","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7722-9431-e05722ae9c65","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual dessas aves est\u00e1 extinta?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O dod\u00f4 vivia apenas na Ilha Maur\u00edcio; a ca\u00e7a e os animais introduzidos pelo homem contribu\u00edram para sua extin\u00e7\u00e3o.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7239-ab06-068584d4b58e","description":"Dodo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7b33-bd5d-5e9d760a3a5b","description":"Coruja","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-78a9-8f2a-13af4476d083","description":"Pintassilgo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7a4c-9794-2c836281fd80","description":"Cegonha-preta","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7d17-b717-9a151e92f413","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama o filhote de ovelha?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"As ovelhas s\u00e3o ruminantes, e seus filhotes s\u00e3o comumente chamados de cordeiros.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7b89-877e-e044bdaf1356","description":"Um cordeiro","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7e26-b90b-5a5d9d883371","description":"Uma larva","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-796f-bdd6-7bdaccbec7b7","description":"Uma lagarta","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7e37-8eda-b02ccf8852ae","description":"Um alevino","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7119-b3a2-7a127d184ad5","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual tecnologia foi desenvolvida inicialmente para as For\u00e7as Armadas dos EUA e agora \u00e9 usada para navega\u00e7\u00e3o?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O GPS foi desenvolvido pelo Departamento de Defesa dos EUA; seus sinais de sat\u00e9lite s\u00e3o agora utilizados em telefones, carros e dispositivos de mapeamento.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7e59-a9a6-5e1960c4f907","description":"GPS","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-73a2-b665-dabeb484e3bd","description":"BPS","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-778c-bebc-e8e1a5c19da8","description":"LPS","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af3