rbonetos n\u00e3o queimados em gases menos nocivos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7c06-8b01-d15caed52e4f","description":"Conversor catal\u00edtico","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-787f-8680-5e03ebac85fc","description":"Silenciador","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7b7a-b601-9d558fe1771c","description":"Coletor de escape","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7a50-95e3-220acd0f8077","description":"Turbocompressor","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-75b5-9f28-27cdd7b0d2ed","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Uma usina com turbinas instaladas em torres altas, em colinas ou no mar, gera eletricidade a partir de qual fonte de energia?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"As turbinas e\u00f3licas transformam a energia cin\u00e9tica do vento em eletricidade; \u201cenergia e\u00f3lica\u201d \u00e9 outro termo para energia do vento.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7db7-aa71-774f3e5c785d","description":"E\u00f3lica","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-70f8-80e5-bb736c45e848","description":"Solar","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-716a-a27c-7679b6754cde","description":"Maremotriz","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7823-b011-207aa52bd280","description":"Nuclear","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7820-8e28-3e9bd691ed93","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual esp\u00e9cie de planta, cujo nome cient\u00edfico \u00e9 Chrysanthemum maximum, inclui a variedade Shasta?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A margarida Shasta \u00e9 uma margarida de jardim cultivada, desenvolvida por Luther Burbank e batizada em homenagem ao Monte Shasta, coberto de neve.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7f66-ab56-a1bafc8b1469","description":"Margarida","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-786a-8bf7-49d22ddf0b32","description":"Rosa","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7ae2-816e-2fea681e3296","description":"Tulipa","correct_answer":false},{"id