 doen\u00e7a sexualmente transmiss\u00edvel?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A clam\u00eddia \u00e9 causada pela bact\u00e9ria Chlamydia trachomatis e geralmente \u00e9 cur\u00e1vel com antibi\u00f3ticos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7722-a036-4659a308615c","description":"Clam\u00eddia","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7d2f-a573-de9f2eaf626e","description":"Doen\u00e7a de Parkinson","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-73f1-a471-a18736e7f018","description":"C\u00e2ncer de tireoide","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-728e-91c2-f68399042fb0","description":"Gastrite","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7fe9-883f-c0d86f4cd3e4","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Onde podemos encontrar estalactites?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"As estalactites se formam no teto das cavernas \u00e0 medida que os minerais se depositam; as estalagmites crescem para cima a partir do ch\u00e3o das cavernas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7a2a-9e60-5140c6c18f89","description":"Em uma caverna","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7cf9-a88a-d7f1e1415b62","description":"No deserto","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7811-8e44-91f4fb9a7870","description":"Em uma floresta","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-765f-b015-dbe9e5c09278","description":"Na cozinha","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7fb7-8f43-3a1112e09d6e","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como voc\u00ea chamaria um filhote de r\u00e3?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O girino \u00e9 o est\u00e1gio larval aqu\u00e1tico da r\u00e3; \u00e0 medida que se desenvolve, ele desenvolve pernas e perde a cauda.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-af30-70aa-9edb-88d0a9040676","description":"Um girino","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-7836-9773-82533c9e1f52","description":"Um bezerro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-af30-761f-826c-933a9f945d3b","description":"Um leit\u00e3o","correct_answer